{"id":93,"slug":"ma-jain-zh","resourceId":56,"nameNative":"马坚译（中文）","nameAr":"ما جيان","nameEn":"Chinese Translation (Ma Jian)","lang":"zh","source":"Quran.com API v4","sourceUrl":"https://quran.com","verses":[{"verseNumber":1,"verseKey":"93:1","text":"誓以上午，"},{"verseNumber":2,"verseKey":"93:2","text":"誓以黑夜，当其寂静的时候，"},{"verseNumber":3,"verseKey":"93:3","text":"你的主没有弃绝你，也没有怨恨你；"},{"verseNumber":4,"verseKey":"93:4","text":"後世於你，确比今世更好；"},{"verseNumber":5,"verseKey":"93:5","text":"你的主将来必赏赐你，以至你喜悦。"},{"verseNumber":6,"verseKey":"93:6","text":"难道他没有发现你伶仃孤苦，而使你有所归宿？"},{"verseNumber":7,"verseKey":"93:7","text":"他曾发现你徘徊歧途，而把你引入正路；"},{"verseNumber":8,"verseKey":"93:8","text":"发现你家境寒苦，而使你衣食丰足。"},{"verseNumber":9,"verseKey":"93:9","text":"至於孤儿，你不要压迫他；"},{"verseNumber":10,"verseKey":"93:10","text":"至於乞丐，你不要喝斥他，"},{"verseNumber":11,"verseKey":"93:11","text":"至於你的主所赐你的恩典呢，你应当宣示它。"}]}